          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ɛ jɛn bi Ä-ron cu luny kɛmɛkä ro̱mä kɛ Kuoth Nhial, bɛ bieyni bööthä palä ben ka̱m raar tin cɛ bat guäth in wee gua̱a̱th in rɛl gɔɔydɛ rɔ, bɛ kɛ cu ba̱ny ɛn wi̱ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bɛ rɔ puɔk guäth mi rɛl gɔɔydɛ rɔ, kä bɛ bieynikɛ cu la̱th, kä bɛ cu ben raar bɛ muc mi waŋ ben thöp kɛ kui̱dɛ, kɛ luur mi waŋ kɛ kui̱ nath bɛ rɔ cu luɛl kɛnɛ naath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bɛ thiɔl luurä dui̱rä waŋ wi̱i̱ yi̱kä bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn ram min ci dɛl jak kä wä däärdɔaar kä A-dha-dhel, a jɛ lak bieynikɛ kä bɛ puaak, bɛ kulɛ ben wi̱c. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn thäk min mɔ luur dui̱rä kɛnɛ böw min mɔ luur dui̱rä tin ca riɛmdiɛn nööŋ min lakkɛ gua̱a̱th in rɛl gɔɔydɛ rɔ, ba kɛ naŋ raar jɔk wec, köl, ri̱ŋ kɛ nyin jiɛc diaal ba kɛ waŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn ram ɔ waaŋ kɛ mɔ, bɛ bieynikɛ lak kä bɛ puaak, bɛ ku lɛ ben wi̱c.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ti̱t ca̱ŋ luël",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nɛmɛ ba ŋuɔ̱t mi do̱raar kä yɛ, ɛn ɣöö kɛ cäŋ kä wäl kä pay bärɔw (yietni) yɛn ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl kɛ nɛy tɔ̱ cieŋ rɛydun tɔ, bia thɛɛk kä thil ɛ la̱t mi bia la̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ bayɛ luɛl kä ba yɛ lak kä dueerkun diaal, bia cu gɔw nhiam Kuɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ ɛ cäŋ lɔ̱ŋädun, bia pua̱nykun jay, ɛ cäŋ leyä mi do̱raar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn bööth palä mɔ yi̱r kɛ mɔ kä lɛ̈ykɛ, kɛ ɣöö bɛ gua̱a̱th gua̱n ka̱n ala bööth palä in di̱i̱t, a jɛ luel kä a jɛ läth bieyni bööthä palä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bɛ gua̱a̱th in rɛl gɔɔydɛ rɔ lak, kɛnɛ kɛmɛkä ro̱mä kɛ Kuoth Nhial kɛ yi̱k, bɛ kɛ lak amäni bööth palä kɛ ji̱ dolä diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn mɛmɛ ba jɛn ŋuɔ̱t mi do̱raar kä yɛ, ɛn ɣöö ba nath lak kä kɛ kɛ ruɔ̱n, dueer ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal.” Inɔ cu Muthɛ ɛ la̱t ce̱tnikɛ min ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ la̱t jɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
